##### Part 2 extra: the same pingpong without wait(0), and with ONE pipe
init: starting sh
$ ppnowait
4: received ping
3: received pong
$ ppnowait
6: received ping
5: received pong
$ pp1pipe
7: received pong
(pp1pipe printed only 'pong' and then hung: the parent read back its own
 byte, so the child stayed blocked in read and wait(0) never returned.)
